r. According to an estimate, the economic loss was", "conf": 0.912, "box": [[115, 752], [1206, 741], [1206, 772], [115, 784]]}, {"text": "about 30 billion dollars.", "conf": 0.841, "box": [[117, 793], [390, 791], [391, 818], [117, 820]]}, {"text": "o Droughts severelyaffecttheproductionof", "conf": 0.889, "box": [[84, 838], [637, 832], [637, 862], [85, 868]]}, {"text": "cropsandlivestock.Accordingtoworldfood", "conf": 0.915, "box": [[635, 833], [1204, 824], [1204, 853], [635, 862]]}, {"text": "program, Balochistan, parts of Sindh and Punjab provinces face serious threats of droughts", "conf": 0.931, "box": [[115, 879], [1203, 864], [1203, 897], [116, 912]]}, {"text": "after every 4-5 years.The drought of 1998-2002 is considered the worst in the history.", "conf": 0.91, "box": [[117, 920], [1104, 907], [1104, 937], [118, 950]]}, {"text": "awaz", "conf": 0.664, "box": [[230, 1026], [415, 943], [440, 998], [255, 1081]]}, {"text": "Flood inPakistan", "conf": 0.882, "box": [[526, 1624], [699, 1627], [698, 1651], [526, 1648]]}, {"text": "76", "conf": 0.666, "box": [[616, 1692], [654, 1692], [654, 1726], [616, 1726]]}, {"text": "Unit 5:NaturalDisasters", "conf": 0.854, "box": [[973, 1690], [1212, 1687], [1212, 1714], [973, 1717]]}]}